#: cli/doctor.php
#, php-format
msgid "Available repairs: %s"
msgstr "Ibikorwa byo gusana biboneka: %s"

#: cli/doctor.php
#, php-format
msgid "Unknown format %s. Use text, json, nagios, or prometheus."
msgstr "Imiterere itazwi %s. Koresha text, json, nagios, cyangwa prometheus."

#: cli/doctor.php
#, php-format
msgid "Redaction could not complete, so %s was not written."
msgstr "Guhisha amakuru y'ibanga ntibyashoboye kurangira, bityo %s ntiyanditswe."

#: cli/doctor.php
#, php-format
msgid "Wrote %s. Review it before sharing; values after password, secret, token, and community names are masked."
msgstr "Handitswe %s. Yisuzume mbere yo kuyisangiza abandi; indangagaciro zikurikira ijambobanga, ibanga, token, n'amazina ya community byahishwe."

#: cli/doctor.php doctor_functions.php
msgid "Unknown repair"
msgstr "Igikorwa cyo gusana kitazwi"

#: cli/doctor.php
msgid "Refusing to repair without --yes."
msgstr "Kwanga gusana nta --yes."

#: cli/doctor.php
msgid "Select a supported symptom and text or JSON output."
msgstr "Hitamo ikimenyetso cyemewe n'ibisohoka mu buryo bwa text cyangwa JSON."

#: cli/doctor.php doctor_web.php
msgid "Accepted warning"
msgstr "Iburira ryemewe"

#: doctor_access.php doctor_functions.php
msgid "Device availability"
msgstr "Ukuboneka kw'igikoresho"

#: doctor_access.php
msgid "Device permissions could not be evaluated."
msgstr "Uburenganzira bw'igikoresho ntibwashoboye gusuzumwa."

#: doctor_access.php
msgid "The configured PHP CLI cannot run Doctor checks."
msgstr "PHP CLI yashyizweho ntishobora gukora igenzura rya Doctor."

#: doctor_access.php
msgid "Doctor checks failed or exceeded their time limit. Review the Doctor log."
msgstr "Igenzura rya Doctor ryatsinzwe cyangwa ryarenze igihe cyaryo ntarengwa. Suzuma inyandiko-mvugo ya Doctor."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Graphs stopped updating"
msgstr "Ibishushanyo byahagaritse kuvugururwa"

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Polling is slow"
msgstr "Ikusanyamakuru riragenda gahoro"

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Devices are missing or unavailable"
msgstr "Ibikoresho birabura cyangwa ntibiboneka"

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Doctor alerts are missing"
msgstr "Impuruza za Doctor zirabura"

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Check the poller scheduler and the affected poller log, then verify a new completed cycle."
msgstr "Genzura gahunda ya poller n'inyandiko-mvugo ya poller yagize ikibazo, hanyuma wemeze ko hari umuzenguruko mushya warangiye."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Collection may have stopped."
msgstr "Ikusanyamakuru rishobora kuba ryarahagaze."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Collected values may not be reaching disk."
msgstr "Ibipimo byakusanyijwe bishobora kuba bitagera kuri disiki."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Inspect the output queue and Boost flush history; verify that the queue drains and RRD timestamps advance."
msgstr "Genzura umurongo w'ibisohoka n'amateka yo koza kwa Boost; wemeze ko umurongo ugenda ugabanuka kandi ibihe bya RRD bijya imbere."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Check storage capacity, runtime-directory permissions and the last RRD update; account for deferred writes."
msgstr "Genzura ubushobozi bw'ububiko, uburenganzira bw'ububiko bw'imikorere n'ivugurura rya RRD riheruka; wite no ku nyandiko zasubitswe."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "RRD storage needs investigation."
msgstr "Ububiko bwa RRD bukeneye isuzuma."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Collection work may be exceeding its time budget."
msgstr "Igikorwa cyo gukusanya gishobora kuba kirengeje igihe cyagenewe."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Compare cycle duration with the polling interval and inspect device timeouts before increasing concurrency."
msgstr "Gereranya uburebure bw'umuzenguruko n'intera yo gukusanya kandi ugenzure igihe ibikoresho bitinda mbere yo kongera ibikorwa bikorerwa icyarimwe."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Compare database counters during a slow cycle and inspect query plans before changing server limits."
msgstr "Gereranya ibipimo by'ububiko bw'amakuru mu muzenguruko utinda kandi ugenzure gahunda z'ibibazo mbere yo guhindura imipaka ya seriveri."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Database pressure may be contributing to slow polling."
msgstr "Umuvuduko mwinshi ku bubiko bw'amakuru ushobora kuba ugira uruhare mu itinda ryo gukusanya."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Collection prerequisites or reachability may be failing."
msgstr "Ibisabwa mbere byo gukusanya cyangwa uburyo bwo kugera ku bikoresho bishobora kuba bidakora."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Verify the affected device permissions, reachability, credentials and assigned poller using Cacti diagnostics."
msgstr "Emeza uburenganzira bw'igikoresho cyagize ikibazo, uburyo bwo kukigeraho, ibyangombwa byo kwinjira na poller yahawe ukoresheje isuzuma rya Cacti."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Scheduled checks or mail delivery need attention."
msgstr "Isuzuma ryagenwe ku gihe cyangwa iyoherezwa ry'ubutumwa bw'imeli bikeneye kwitabwaho."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Verify scheduling and recipient settings, inspect retained delivery attempts, and send a Cacti test email."
msgstr "Emeza igenamiterere rya gahunda n'abakira ubutumwa, ugenzure ibigeragezo byo kohereza byabitswe, kandi wohereze imeli y'igerageza ya Cacti."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Possible causes require verification; matching checks do not establish a root cause."
msgstr "Impamvu zishoboka zikeneye kwemezwa; isuzuma rihura ntirigaragaza impamvu nyakuri."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "No cause is established by the available observations. Run fresh diagnostics and investigate the symptom directly."
msgstr "Nta mpamvu igaragazwa n'ibimaze kuboneka. Kora isuzuma rishya kandi ushakishe ikimenyetso ubwacyo."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "At least 24 hours since server startup and FLUSH STATUS. Counters are cumulative and may have different reset histories; confirm trends during a representative workload before tuning."
msgstr "Nibura amasaha 24 kuva seriveri itangiye na FLUSH STATUS. Ibipimo biriyongera kandi bishobora kuba byaratangijwe bushya mu bihe bitandukanye; emeza icyerekezo mu gihe cy'akazi gahagije mbere yo kubitunganya."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Cumulative tuning advice is deferred: obtain valid uptime and at least 24 hours since startup and FLUSH STATUS. Missing metrics or an inconsistent sample cannot establish database health."
msgstr "Inama zo gutunganya zisubitswe: shaka igihe cyo gukora cyizewe nibura amasaha 24 kuva itangiye na FLUSH STATUS. Ibipimo bibura cyangwa icyitegererezo kidahuye ntibishobora kwerekana ubuzima bw'ububiko bw'amakuru."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Database observation window"
msgstr "Igihe cyo kwitegereza ububiko bw'amakuru"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Connection metrics are unavailable or invalid. Check access to SHOW GLOBAL STATUS and SHOW GLOBAL VARIABLES; do not treat missing metrics as an idle server."
msgstr "Ibipimo by'ihuzanzira ntibiboneka cyangwa ntibyemewe. Genzura uburenganzira kuri SHOW GLOBAL STATUS na SHOW GLOBAL VARIABLES; ntufate ibipimo bibura nka seriveri itari gukora."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Current connections: %.0f / %.0f (%s); recorded peak: %.0f (%s of the current limit)."
msgstr "Ihuzanzira ririho ubu: %.0f / %.0f (%s); igipimo cyo hejuru cyanditswe: %.0f (%s ku mupaka uriho ubu)."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Review connection pooling and poller concurrency. Check database-host memory headroom before raising max_connections; the historical peak may reflect an older limit."
msgstr "Subiramo imicungire yo guhuza ihuzanzira n'ibikorwa bya poller bikorerwa icyarimwe. Genzura umwanya w'ububiko bw'akanya gato bwa seriveri y'ububiko bw'amakuru mbere yo kuzamura max_connections; igipimo cyo hejuru cyahise gishobora kugaragaza umupaka wa kera."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Connection capacity"
msgstr "Ubushobozi bw'ihuzanzira"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "InnoDB buffer pool reads"
msgstr "Isoma rya InnoDB buffer pool"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Review query plans and the working set. Consider innodb_buffer_pool_size only after measuring memory available on the database host; a cumulative miss ratio alone does not prove memory pressure."
msgstr "Subiramo gahunda z'ibibazo n'ibyiciro by'akazi. Tekereza kuri innodb_buffer_pool_size gusa nyuma yo gupima ububiko bw'akanya gato buhari kuri seriveri y'ububiko bw'amakuru; igipimo rusange cyo kubura mu bubiko ubwacyo nticyerekana umuvuduko w'ububiko."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "On-disk temporary tables"
msgstr "Imbonerahamwe z'agateganyo kuri disiki"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Review query plans, sorting, grouping, and temporary-table data types before changing memory limits. Some tables must use disk; memory limits and accounting differ between MySQL and MariaDB versions."
msgstr "Subiramo gahunda z'ibibazo, itondeka, ihuriza mu byiciro, n'ubwoko bw'amakuru bw'imbonerahamwe z'agateganyo mbere yo guhindura imipaka y'ububiko bw'akanya gato. Imbonerahamwe zimwe zigomba gukoresha disiki; imipaka y'ububiko bw'akanya gato n'imibarire biratandukana hagati ya verisiyo za MySQL na MariaDB."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Connection thread creation"
msgstr "Ihangwa rya thread z'ihuzanzira"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Review connection reuse and thread_cache_size. Check the server thread-handling mode before tuning; thread-pool implementations do not behave like one-thread-per-connection servers."
msgstr "Subiramo ukongera gukoresha ihuzanzira na thread_cache_size. Genzura uburyo seriveri icunga thread mbere yo gutunganya; imikorere ya thread-pool ntikora kimwe na seriveri za thread imwe kuri buri huzanzira."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Review slow-query logging, long_query_time, and query plans before changing server buffers. This counter depends on the configured slow-query threshold and does not identify individual statements."
msgstr "Subiramo inyandiko-mvugo y'ibibazo bitinda, long_query_time, na gahunda z'ibibazo mbere yo guhindura ububiko bw'akanya gato bwa seriveri. Iki gipimo gishingira ku mupaka wagenwe w'ibibazo bitinda kandi ntikigaragaza buri nteruro yihariye."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Slow statements"
msgstr "Interuro zitinda"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Cumulative advice deferred until the observation window is sufficient."
msgstr "Inama rusange zisubitswe kugeza igihe cyo kwitegereza gihagije."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Thread-cache advice is not assessed: thread_handling is unavailable or is not one-thread-per-connection. Review the active thread-pool implementation instead."
msgstr "Inama kuri thread-cache ntizisuzumwe: thread_handling ntiboneka cyangwa si thread imwe kuri buri huzanzira. Ahubwo subiramo imikorere ya thread-pool iri gukora."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Required counters are missing or invalid: %s, %s. Check server-version support and monitoring permissions."
msgstr "Ibipimo bisabwa birabura cyangwa ntibyemewe: %s, %s. Genzura ubufasha bwa verisiyo ya seriveri n'uburenganzira bwo kugenzura."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "A counter reset since the prior sample; collect another representative interval before tuning."
msgstr "Igipimo cyasubijwe ku ntangiriro kuva ku cyitegererezo cyabanje; kusanya ikindi gihe gihagije mbere yo gutunganya."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Insufficient activity: %.0f %s; at least %d observations are needed for this advisory."
msgstr "Ibikorwa bidahagije: %.0f %s; hakenewe nibura ibyitegererezo %d kuri iyi nama."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Counters are inconsistent or were reset independently. Collect a new representative sample before tuning."
msgstr "Ibipimo ntibihura cyangwa byasubijwe ku ntangiriro bitandukanye. Kusanya icyitegererezo gishya gihagije mbere yo gutunganya."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The interval sample is too small or counters reset; collect another representative interval before tuning."
msgstr "Icyitegererezo cy'igihe ni gito cyane cyangwa ibipimo byasubijwe ku ntangiriro; kusanya ikindi gihe gihagije mbere yo gutunganya."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Interval %s / %s: %.0f / %.0f (%s); investigation threshold: %s."
msgstr "Intera %s / %s: %.0f / %.0f (%s); umupaka w'isuzuma: %s."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Cumulative %s / %s: %.0f / %.0f (%s); investigation threshold: %s."
msgstr "Igiteranyo %s / %s: %.0f / %.0f (%s); umupaka w'isuzuma: %s."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "This counter can omit memory-mapped temporary files on MySQL; a low ratio does not rule out disk use."
msgstr "Iki gipimo gishobora kwirengagiza dosiye z'agateganyo zihujwe n'ububiko bw'akanya gato kuri MySQL; igipimo gito ntikivuga ko disiki itakoreshejwe."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Redo-log advice deferred until the observation window is sufficient and Innodb_log_waits is available."
msgstr "Inama kuri redo-log zisubitswe kugeza igihe cyo kwitegereza gihagije kandi Innodb_log_waits iboneka."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Cumulative Innodb_log_waits: %.0f."
msgstr "Igiteranyo cya Innodb_log_waits: %.0f."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Investigate transaction sizes, log-buffer pressure, and storage latency. Recheck the rate under load before considering innodb_log_buffer_size; this historical count is not evidence of a current stall."
msgstr "Suzuma ubunini bw'ibikorwa, umuvuduko wa log-buffer, n'itinda ry'ububiko. Ongera ugenzure umuvuduko mu gihe hari akazi kenshi mbere yo gutekereza kuri innodb_log_buffer_size; iyi mibare y'amateka si ikimenyetso cy'ihagarara ririho ubu."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "InnoDB log-buffer waits"
msgstr "Gutegereza kwa InnoDB log-buffer"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "installed Cacti composer.json"
msgstr "composer.json ya Cacti yashyizweho"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Cacti %s installer requirement"
msgstr "Ibisabwa byo gushyiraho Cacti %s"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "PHP compatibility with installed Cacti"
msgstr "Ihuzabikorwa rya PHP na Cacti yashyizweho"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Running PHP %s; installed Cacti %s."
msgstr "PHP iri gukora ni %s; Cacti yashyizweho ni %s."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Could not establish Cacti's PHP requirement. Check the installed Cacti composer.json or release documentation; Doctor does not assume compatibility."
msgstr "Ntibyashobotse kumenya ibisabwa bya PHP bya Cacti. Genzura composer.json ya Cacti yashyizweho cyangwa inyandiko z'isohoka; Doctor ntifata ko bihura itabisuzumye."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "PHP >= %s and < %s"
msgstr "PHP >= %s na < %s"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "PHP >= %s"
msgstr "PHP >= %s"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Requires %s (%s). Running PHP meets that requirement."
msgstr "Bisaba %s (%s). PHP iri gukora yujuje ibyo bisabwa."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Requires %s (%s). Running PHP does not meet that requirement."
msgstr "Bisaba %s (%s). PHP iri gukora ntiyujuje ibyo bisabwa."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Detected %s; Doctor requires Cacti 1.2.20 or newer."
msgstr "Habonetse %s; Doctor isaba Cacti 1.2.20 cyangwa iyisumbuyeho."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Supported Cacti version"
msgstr "Verisiyo ya Cacti ifashwa"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "PHP upstream security support"
msgstr "Ubufasha bw'umutekano bwa PHP buva ku isoko"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "This checks the PHP release branch, not whether this patch release is up to date or whether your OS vendor backports fixes. Cacti compatibility is checked separately."
msgstr "Ibi bigenzura ishami ry'isohoka rya PHP, ntibisuzuma niba iyi verisiyo y'inyongerabumenyi igezweho cyangwa niba utanga sisitemu yawe ashyiramo ibikosora bya kera. Ihuzabikorwa rya Cacti risuzumwa ukwaryo."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Running PHP %s; upstream security-support status is unknown or this is a prerelease. Check https://www.php.net/supported-versions.php and update Doctor's support data."
msgstr "PHP iri gukora ni %s; uko ubufasha bw'umutekano buva ku isoko buhagaze ntibizwi cyangwa iyi ni verisiyo y'ibanze. Genzura https://www.php.net/supported-versions.php kandi uvugurure amakuru y'ubufasha ya Doctor."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Running PHP %s; PHP %s receives upstream security fixes through %s."
msgstr "PHP iri gukora ni %s; PHP %s ihabwa ibikosora by'umutekano biva ku isoko kugeza ku ya %s."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Running PHP %s; PHP %s no longer receives upstream security fixes; support ended %s. Upgrade to a supported PHP branch compatible with your Cacti installation, or confirm security maintenance with your OS vendor."
msgstr "PHP iri gukora ni %s; PHP %s ntigihabwa ibikosora by'umutekano biva ku isoko; ubufasha bwarangiye ku ya %s. Vugurura ujye ku ishami rya PHP rifashwa kandi rihura na Cacti yawe, cyangwa wemeze ibijyanye no kubungabunga umutekano n'utanga sisitemu yawe."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Required current CLI PHP extensions"
msgstr "Imigereka ya CLI PHP isabwa iriho ubu"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Required web PHP extensions"
msgstr "Imigereka ya PHP y'urubuga isabwa"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Missing: %s. Install them through the operating system package manager."
msgstr "Ibibura: %s. Bishyiremo ukoresheje igikoresho gicunga paki za sisitemu y'imikorere."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "All PHP extensions required by the Cacti installer are loaded in this PHP context."
msgstr "Imigereka yose ya PHP isabwa n'igishyiraho Cacti yafunguwe muri iki gice cya PHP."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Doctor does not execute configured binaries while running as root."
msgstr "Doctor ntikoresha porogaramu zagenwe mu gihe ikora nka root."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "The file name %s is not expected for %s, so Doctor did not execute it."
msgstr "Izina rya dosiye %s ntiryari ryitezwe kuri %s, bityo Doctor ntiyarikoresheje."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Doctor is running as root, so permission checks describe root rather than the web server or poller account, configured binaries are not executed, and repairs are refused. Run Doctor as the Cacti poller user."
msgstr "Doctor iri gukora nka root, bityo isuzuma ry'uburenganzira risobanura root aho kuba seriveri y'urubuga cyangwa konti ya poller, porogaramu zagenwe ntizikoreshwa, kandi ibikorwa byo gusana birangwa. Koresha Doctor nk'ukoresha wa poller ya Cacti."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Doctor privileges"
msgstr "Uburenganzira bwa Doctor"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Doctor is running without root privileges."
msgstr "Doctor iri gukora idafite uburenganzira bwa root."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Required CLI PHP extensions"
msgstr "Imigereka ya CLI PHP isabwa"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The configured PHP CLI executable is unavailable, so its extensions cannot be checked."
msgstr "Porogaramu ya PHP CLI yagenwe ntiboneka, bityo imigereka yayo ntishobora kugenzurwa."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "shell_exec() is disabled, so Doctor cannot compare the CLI PHP extensions with Cacti requirements."
msgstr "shell_exec() yahagaritswe, bityo Doctor ntishobora kugereranya imigereka ya CLI PHP n'ibisabwa bya Cacti."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The configured PHP CLI executable did not return a valid extension list."
msgstr "Porogaramu ya PHP CLI yagenwe ntiyatanze urutonde rw'imigereka rwemewe."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Missing from CLI PHP: %s. The web and CLI PHP configurations are separate on many systems."
msgstr "Bibura muri CLI PHP: %s. Igenamiterere rya PHP y'urubuga n'iya CLI bitandukana kuri sisitemu nyinshi."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The configured PHP CLI has every extension required by Cacti."
msgstr "PHP CLI yagenwe ifite buri mugereka usabwa na Cacti."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "GD TrueType support"
msgstr "Ubufasha bwa GD TrueType"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Recommended PHP features"
msgstr "Imikorere ya PHP igirwamo inama"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Unavailable: %s. Cacti can run without these features, but related functionality may be limited."
msgstr "Ntibiboneka: %s. Cacti ishobora gukora idafite iyi mikorere, ariko ibikorwa bijyanye nayo bishobora kugira imipaka."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The optional gettext, SNMP, and GD TrueType features are available."
msgstr "Imikorere itari itegeko ya gettext, SNMP, na GD TrueType iraboneka."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "memory_limit is %s (%dM or more is recommended)"
msgstr "memory_limit ni %s (%dM cyangwa irenga igirwamo inama)"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "max_execution_time is %d seconds (60 or more is recommended)"
msgstr "max_execution_time ni amasegonda %d (60 cyangwa arenga agirwamo inama)"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "date.timezone is not set"
msgstr "date.timezone ntiyashyizweho"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "unset"
msgstr "ntibyashyizweho"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s. Current values: %s"
msgstr "%s. Agaciro kariho ubu: %s"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "PHP runtime configuration"
msgstr "Igenamiterere ry'imikorere ya PHP"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Database connection"
msgstr "Ihuzanzira ry'ububiko bw'amakuru"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Query failed: %s"
msgstr "Ikibazo cyananiwe: %s"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "A read-only query completed successfully."
msgstr "Ikibazo cyo gusoma gusa cyarangiye neza."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The database returned an unexpected result."
msgstr "Ububiko bw'amakuru bwatanze igisubizo kitari cyitezwe."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Doctor could not determine the database server version from %s."
msgstr "Doctor ntiyashoboye kumenya verisiyo ya seriveri y'ububiko bw'amakuru kuva kuri %s."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Supported database server"
msgstr "Seriveri y'ububiko bw'amakuru ifashwa"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s %s detected; this Cacti branch recommends %s %s or newer."
msgstr "Habonetse %s %s; iri shami rya Cacti rigira inama %s %s cyangwa iyisumbuyeho."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Database character set is %s and collation is %s. Cacti requires utf8mb4."
msgstr "Imyandikire y'ububiko bw'amakuru ni %s kandi itondeka ni %s. Cacti isaba utf8mb4."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "unknown"
msgstr "ntibizwi"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Database character set"
msgstr "Imyandikire y'ububiko bw'amakuru"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Database timezone support"
msgstr "Ubufasha bw'isaha y'ububiko bw'amakuru"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The Cacti database account cannot read mysql.time_zone_name. Grant SELECT access and populate the database timezone tables."
msgstr "Konti y'ububiko bw'amakuru ya Cacti ntishobora gusoma mysql.time_zone_name. Tanga uburenganzira bwa SELECT kandi wuzuze imbonerahamwe z'amasaha z'ububiko bw'amakuru."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "The database timezone table is accessible and contains %d entries."
msgstr "Imbonerahamwe y'isaha y'ububiko bw'amakuru iragerwaho kandi irimo ibyinjijwe %d."

#: doctor_functions.php
