msgid "Cacti Log Size Warning (MB)"
msgstr "Umuburo w'ingano y'inyandiko-mvugo ya Cacti (MB)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Warn when the Cacti log grows beyond this size, which usually means log rotation is not running."
msgstr "Tanga umuburo iyo inyandiko-mvugo ya Cacti irenze iyi ngano, ibyo akenshi bivuze ko ihinduranya ry'inyandiko-mvugo ridakora."
